ault-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Jade Hammer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jade_Hammer_61a652.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Flail\"><img alt=\"Onyx Flail\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Onyx_Flail_179bb5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.30<br/>December 11, 2013<br/>Winter Update 2013</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Dark Grounds</b> is a small enclosed area in <a href=\"#/wiki/Upper%20Roshamuul\">Upper Roshamuul</a>, north of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul\">Roshamuul</a> depot. It's accessible only during an unannounced world change triggered by completing the <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul%20Quest%2FSpoiler\">Roshamuul Quest - Soothing Bad Dreams</a> task 20 times in an unknown amount of days. Due to the unpopularity of this task, the Dark Grounds are not often accessible. In response to this, CipSoft lowered the requirements to open the area in a patch on March 3, 2015, but even after this change this place is still rarely accessible.\n</p><p>This area is a hunting place for <a href=\"#/wiki/Sight%20of%20Surrender\">Sights of Surrender</a>, divided in two sections with 3 Sights of Surrenders each. It doesn't have any other monsters, which is the primary reason one would prefer hunting here over the <a href=\"#/wiki/Guzzlemaw%20Valley\">Guzzlemaw Valley</a>. Otherwise, there is nothing of interest here. \n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sight%20of%20Surrender\"><img alt=\"Sight of Surrender\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sight_of_Surrender_043475.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Sight%20of%20Surrender\">Sight of Surrender</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">17,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">28,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">2500</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-20× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Broken Visor (common)</li>\n<li>Sight of Surrender's Eye (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate Health Potion</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Spirit%20Potion\">Great Spirit Potion</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Crystal%20Splinter\">Blue Crystal Splinter</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Crystal%20Splinter\">Green Crystal Splinter</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× Brown Crystal Splinter (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Crystal%20Shard\">Violet Crystal Shard</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Crystal%20Shard\">Blue Crystal Shard</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Crystal%20Shard\">Green Crystal Shard</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Might%20Ring\">Might Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Crystal Mace (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cluster%20of%20Solace\">Cluster of Solace</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Magic Plate Armor (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Boots\">Steel Boots</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Jade Hammer (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\">Tower Shield</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Hammer of Wrath (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Flail\">Onyx Flail</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crusader%20Helmet\">Crusader Helmet</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crown%20Legs\">Crown Legs</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>String of Mending (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["roshamuul-quest"]}